        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An employee who is eligible for the Retiree Medical Plan at the time active employment with the Company ends and who deferts his or her retirement benefits also must defer enrollment in the Retiree Medical Plan until the date benefits begin under the Company-sponsored retirement plan.",
